# lock: Lock Screen page. Check in each look (Material starts with "Clock" carousel; Glass has "Cards and field").
ipc panels settings lock
wait 2
shot lock-top
note L1: Material starts with "Clock" (carousel, Size, Thickness) and has the Clock width/digits group in More options; Glass has neither but has "Cards and field". Same texts, footers and order as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 5
wait 1
shot lock-mid
note L1 cont.: middle of the page (Notifications Beside/Icons, Layout, Bedside Mode): same labels, details, footers and order as QML.
ptr move 1100 600 scroll 0 10
wait 1
shot lock-end
note L1 cont.: end of the page (buttons "Preview Login Screen" and "Lock Screen", More options): same as QML.
# MANUAL: L1 open More options and shot to the end.
# MANUAL: L2 click Notifications "Beside" then "Icons": Glass row detail changes; Material group footer changes. Layout "Classic": Glass footer "The clock up top...", Material detail "The clock and the date, nothing under them".
# MANUAL: L3 switch Bedside Mode off, open More options: Prevent burn-in, Wake with the mouse, Clock brightness, Clock weight and "Into Bedside Mode" greyed and non-reactive; labels as QML.
# MANUAL: L4 Accessibility > Reduce motion on, back to Lock: Login intro detail "Off while Reduce motion is on (Accessibility)", Play Intro greyed, switch still usable.
# MANUAL: L5 "Preview Login Screen" opens the login preview (Esc closes); "Lock Screen" locks the arena (then ipc lock unlock).
# MANUAL: L6 Material: choose the analog face in the carousel, open More options: Width and Digits rows hidden.
ipc panels close
